[en.IDEA_C08_LIBERATION_FRONT_7]
Liberation Front

[en.IDEA_C08_LIBERATION_FRONT_7_desc]
Whether called the Liberation Front or the Resistance, this organization established when Starlight Glimmer arrived at Our Town, has an ultimate goal of overthrowing the illegal empire of Cozy Glow, reclaiming all of Equestria, bringing down the “Big Three”, and restoring friendship and harmony to all ponies.
The Front is currently united. Under Starlight’s leadership, ponies have rallied around the banners of harmony and friendship. While minor disputes still exist, ponies are ready to fight at a moment’s notice to liberate Equestria.

§CIt’s not that we have to do this, it’s that we choose to!§!

[zh.IDEA_C08_LIBERATION_FRONT_7]
解放阵线

[zh.IDEA_C08_LIBERATION_FRONT_7_desc]
无论叫做解放阵线抑或是抵抗军，这一星光熠熠流亡平等镇后建立的组织，其最终目的是推翻和煦光流的伪帝国，讨伐“三巨头”，收复全小马利亚，将友谊与谐律重新带给所有小马。
阵线目前团结一致。在星光的领导下，小马们团结在了谐律与友谊的旗帜周围。虽然小矛盾仍然存在，但小马们已经准备好，时刻为解放小马利亚而战。

§C不是我们必须这么做，而是我们选择这么做！§!
